*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0040
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-06-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 302
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0040.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 ACCT-TYPE          PIC X.
    05 ACCT-BALANCE       PIC 9(9)V99.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> APPLIED INTEREST RATE
    05 INT-RATE           PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 2000-RATE-TIER
    DISPLAY "INT-RATE=" INT-RATE
    STOP RUN.
2000-RATE-TIER.
    *> TOP SAVINGS TIER - LIMIT 50000 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF ACCT-TYPE = 'S' AND ACCT-BALANCE >= 100000
        MOVE 0.0450 TO INT-RATE
    *> MIDDLE SAVINGS TIER - LIMIT 12500 PER 1998 POLICY
    ELSE IF ACCT-TYPE = 'S' AND ACCT-BALANCE >= 25000
        MOVE 0.0350 TO INT-RATE
    *> BASE SAVINGS RATE
    ELSE IF ACCT-TYPE = 'S'
        MOVE 0.0275 TO INT-RATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 0.0100 TO INT-RATE
    END-IF
    END-IF
    END-IF.
